vLLM (Apache-2.0): https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm
Copyright contributors to the vLLM project.
The NVFP4 gate/up reconciliation follows upstream PR55073 (9ac09fb algorithm).
nv_runtime.py modifies the pinned GB10 vLLM development build’s attention host launch settings and MoE
reduction/output alias handling at runtime; nv_head.py adapts its logits path.
Modifications restrict execution to a sequential, three-choice decision path.
The optional media recipe retains the vision encoder and query32 attention launch;
it uses pinned vLLM preprocessing before enqueue to enforce expanded token limits.
Synthetic shapes/video examples are project-authored, licensed Apache-2.0.
The vLLM license is included in licenses/vLLM.txt.

