MOSS-Transcribe-Diarize (Apache-2.0): https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Transcribe-Diarize
Copyright OpenMOSS contributors.
audio/moss_parser.py vendors transcript_parser.py from commit
61bc29cd4120be7b5d3b761b64cd5dff57263642, with provenance comments added.
audio/worker.py adapts the official inference_utils.py prompt and preprocessing/generation flow:
local predecoded PCM, hash/version checks, bounded complete output, strict parsing,
content-free failures and structured private results. License: licenses/Apache-2.0-MOSS.txt.
MOSS model weights are downloaded separately at a pinned revision and are not bundled.
